1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:04,490
Who's kicking me out? I'm carrying a Jiang heir

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:12,560
That's your grandson! Would you let him be homeless?

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:16,079
Stop pretending. You're too old
to even get pregnant

4
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:21,220
We're in a hospital, how could I lie?
You... my son begged for years

5
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,740
I'm done for, but the child is the Jiang family's only heir

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,480
In my past life, my husband and mother-in-law
betrayed me and got me killed

7
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,760
This life, I'll make your whole family pay in blood

8
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:35,650
Come wash my feet later

9
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:41,530
Zhang Guifang, don't push it! My precious son says

10
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:44,970
he wants grandma to serve him herself. If she doesn't do it right

11
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:48,330
he won't come out. Sit in there and wait, see who panics

12
00:00:51,500 --> 00:01:02,280
With old Zhang... Honey, honey, calm down!

13
00:00:55,900 --> 00:01:02,280
Careful with the baby in her belly! If it weren't
for the Jiang heir she's carrying,
I'd have thrown you out long ago!

14
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:16,320
Something's wrong. The way Jiang Chenggao
looked... not at a daughter-in-law

15
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:21,360
Ow!

16
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:25,520
Chen Gang, be gentle! I'm carrying
your heir... don't press on him!

